        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Solid oxide fuel cell (SOFC) with unpressurised tubular stack design for central cogeneration use. Performance, stack lifetime and catalyst use according to expected future values for a serial product. Operation with connection to low pressure gas network. Electrical efficiency 47%, total efficiency 80%.\n\n# Included processes\nThe module includes an estimation for materials and transport used for the maintenance of the SOFC fuel cell unit.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
